                            {
                                "example_id": "8bc9466b-d3c2-42fd-96dd-572df0a2b3e2",
                                "sense_id": "42dd8024-6b54-3220-81f0-f5f40b7bf746",
                                "text": "If Bach had any guts, he wouldn't take that. He's too much of a Milquetoast guy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d35c73a-c939-4cc2-adb2-4277b2eb6a31",
                                "sense_id": "42dd8024-6b54-3220-81f0-f5f40b7bf746",
                                "text": "Like that well-meaning mom, parents employ Milquetoast speech whenever they whine, complain, plead, entreat, entice, bribe, and explain themselves persuasively."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "ff1ae25e-ee0f-3924-b5c2-dce0512f2ae5",
                "word": "milquetoast",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e5b5b2bc-8bf8-4e30-a696-0b05998baed5",
                        "entry_id": "ff1ae25e-ee0f-3924-b5c2-dce0512f2ae5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "milquetoasts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                        "entry_id": "ff1ae25e-ee0f-3924-b5c2-dce0512f2ae5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person of meek or timid disposition; a person who lacks character or effectiveness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "297fb7ec-6199-46fa-b960-82e2aa3229df",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "We know that theology must be common to all believers, but again we also know that some enjoy only milquetoast (german milchspeise), while others can eat solid food, and that one and the same truth is apprehended in different ways, for it is not possible to accommodate all these ways to the grasp of all, while not depriving them of the truth itself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "138915a2-7f46-4eb0-94f9-78c8d8ce047c",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "The Milquetoasts of this world seldom wake up in time to get tough effectively, Mr. [Harold Tucker] Webster fears. [...] Webster considers him a worthy citizen—of the kind that had better begin to show a little more spunk before it is too late."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11394f45-911d-43f8-9e14-38bed3aea395",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "The Milquetoasts of this world are the victims of the steamrollers. I used to be numbered among the Milquetoasts and was periodically used or flattened! I came to realize, however, that even though Christians are to be humble and cooperative, they also are accountable to God to use their time wisely, to do what He wants them to do, and to stand up for what is right and biblical."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "389fc461-8c8d-400c-a156-23ab7f3104a6",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "That scientists favored international control of the atom made conservatives even more mistrustful. J[ohn] Parnell Thomas rued the surrender of control to such \"a group of milktoasts.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc21f4e6-bb6f-4b14-a6a1-41c277b4863b",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "Of the thirteen films he [Douglas Fairbanks] made independently, the most noteworthy was WILD AND WOOLLY (1917), a melodramatic story about an Eastern milquetoast who becomes a frontier hero."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6532c130-9d2b-4b20-892b-0583b1497b2e",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "[Clare Boothe Luce] was no woman to be married to a milquetoast, and Henry R[obinson] Luce, cofounder and colorful, forceful honcho of the nascent Time empire, was anything but that."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9543ca2f-cc95-4318-bde9-6dbbb75d7e5f",
                                "sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                                "text": "Initially, our heroine hooks up with some milktoast of a guy with lots of money and little personality. Then he comes along—a man she can't push over, a man her wealth and social position can't influence."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b23487e5-66b9-4cd2-977c-bc861bd894b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff1ae25e-ee0f-3924-b5c2-dce0512f2ae5",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                        "source_sense_description": "person of meek or timid disposition; person who lacks character or effectiveness",
                        "target_lang_word": "Angsthase",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Angsthase",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05251aef-4bd6-305c-adaa-a5e9cb05b427",
                                        "entry_id": "c3d529fe-4b16-3ee8-b596-4cc33f53520c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der sich oft ängstigt oder feige ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05b24d12-5250-43de-8b65-76506a16a261",
                                                "sense_id": "05251aef-4bd6-305c-adaa-a5e9cb05b427",
                                                "text": "Kommst du jetzt mit in die Höhle oder bist du ein Angsthase?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74421a17-4221-4cf4-9698-1f59689f4022",
                                                "sense_id": "05251aef-4bd6-305c-adaa-a5e9cb05b427",
                                                "text": "„Die größten Angsthasen versteckten sich hinter der Theke.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f5824b4-50d9-4a60-ad59-0ede54770ede",
                                                "sense_id": "05251aef-4bd6-305c-adaa-a5e9cb05b427",
                                                "text": "„Manche fachfremde Pädagogen, sagt Bernd Richter, sind im Fach Chemie sogar bekennende Angsthasen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "680cad93-571a-4773-ba94-5af6c1391230",
                                                "sense_id": "05251aef-4bd6-305c-adaa-a5e9cb05b427",
                                                "text": "„Nun stehen diese Angsthasen kurz davor, in Europa die Führung zu übernehmen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31086581-2d58-4b0d-b85f-1539a0bd4c91",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff1ae25e-ee0f-3924-b5c2-dce0512f2ae5",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f5e6331-3ab1-339a-83fa-3e08c29a626e",
                        "source_sense_description": "person of meek or timid disposition; person who lacks character or effectiveness",
